#
# The spec-side folders a clean folder leaves out (CONTRIBUTING.md,
# "Barriers"): the one list the barrier tools and their tests build these
# names from, since M3. Tab-separated: the folder, its kind (source:
# matched as a whole word or a path into it; transcripts: a path into it),
# the transcript check's rule ID and its label (sessions/REVIEWED.json
# names rules by label, so a label never changes). The deny lists in
# config/claude/*.json are Claude Code's own syntax and keep their literal
# paths; C-UNIT checks they cover every folder here.
vendor/emulator	source	F-VENDOR-EMU	vendor/emulator/ (spec side)
harness	source	F-HARNESS	harness/ source (spec side)
sessions/spec	transcripts	F-SPEC-SESSIONS	spec-side session transcripts
